sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Delegating as Delegating Agent
  participant Supervisor as RuntimeSupervisor
  participant Repository as TaskRepository
  participant Worker as Worker Agent

  Delegating->>Supervisor: dispatch round(roundId)
  Supervisor->>Repository: persist round_started(sequence, roundId)
  Supervisor->>Worker: run(roundId)
  Worker-->>Supervisor: ack(roundId)

  loop Every 5 seconds while working
    Worker-->>Supervisor: heartbeat(roundId)
  end

  Worker-->>Supervisor: events(roundId)
  Worker-->>Supervisor: result or error(roundId)
  Supervisor->>Repository: persist round_finished(sequence, roundId)
  Worker-->>Supervisor: released(roundId)
  Supervisor-->>Delegating: next round allowed

  Note over Supervisor,Worker: No rework or Provider fallback before released
  Note over Supervisor: Stale, duplicate, and old roundId messages are ignored
